        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Detroit (film)\n- People: Kathryn Bigelow, Mark Boal\n- Events: Algiers Motel incident, 1967 Detroit riot, Long Hot Summer of 1967\n- Places: Detroit, United States\n\nFacts:\n- The 1967 Detroit riot, also called the 12th Street riot and the 1967 Detroit rebellion, was one of 159 race riots that occurred in cities across the United States during the Long Hot Summer of 1967.\n- The film Detroit is a 2017 American period crime drama film.\n- Kathryn Bigelow directed Detroit, and Mark Boal wrote it.\n- Detroit is based on the Algiers Motel incident during Detroit's 1967 12th Street Riot.\n- The release of Detroit commemorated the 50th anniversary of the Algiers Motel incident and the 1967 Detroit riot.",
